    "excerpt": "By Amjad Javed Hashmi, Advocate Supreme Court 1. Legal burden to pay income tax directly falls upon a person i.e. a technical concept having very broad scope and effect as defined in section 80 of the Income Tax Ordinance, 2001 (the Ordinance). Every taxpayer has to be a person first. Most popular variations of the technical concept of a Continue reading",
