    "title": "BASIC LEGAL FRAMEWORK OF INTERNATIONAL TAXATION IN PAKISTAN-III, TAXATION OF NON-RESIDENTS",
    "excerpt": "By Amjad Javaid Hashmi, Advocate Supreme Court (i) On the principal topic of international taxation regime of Pakistan it is third article in the series and deals with the third theme i.e. taxing income of a non-resident person as dictated in sections 105 and 106 of the Income Tax Ordinance (the Ordinance). On this score, the law is underwritten Continue reading",
