    "excerpt": "PART- 1 INTRODUCTION  To unfold the topic, I will follow in following terms of the divine ordinance as contained in Surah Taha of the Quran with respect to both essence and mode of pleading your contention before an authority (even when it is as good a tyrant as Pharaoh):  Supplication of the Prophet Musa(AS)   رًَ بًِ Continue reading",
