    "title": "When Purity of Tax Justice is at Stake",
    "excerpt": "By Amjad Javaid Hashmi, Advocate Supreme Court & Shahid Ali Qureshi, Advocate High Court This article brings home the constitutional noise and statutory clamor by way of misguided application and affirmation of the ratio of Haji Razzaq’s case (PLD 2017 SC 207) in the case of Searle IV Solutions and others, decided by the Honorable Continue reading",
    "date": "2023-07-09",
    "displayDate": "July 9, 2023",
